{"ticker":{"symbol":"PYPL","name":"PayPal Holdings, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":59.24,"change_pct":0.004748982360922582,"market_cap":49208201216.0,"pe":11.305345,"pb":2.5450015,"dividend_yield":0.009453072248480757,"week52_low":38.46,"week52_high":67.99,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","city":"San Jose","employees":23800,"website":"https://www.paypal.com","business_summary":"PayPal Holdings, Inc. operates a technology platform that enables digital payments for merchants and consumers worldwide. The company operates a two-sided network at scale that connects merchants and consumers that enables its customers to connect, transact, and send and receive payments through online and in person, as well as transfer and withdraw funds using various funding sources, such as bank accounts, PayPal or Venmo account balance, consumer credit and debit products, credit and debit cards, and cryptocurrencies, as well as other stored value products, including gift cards and eligible rewards. It provides payment solutions under the PayPal, PayPal Credit, Braintree, Venmo, Xoom, Hyperwallet, Honey, and Paidy names. The company was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in San Jose, California.","business_summary_ko":"PayPal Holdings, Inc.는 전 세계 판매자와 소비자를 위한 디지털 결제를 가능하게 하는 기술 플랫폼을 운영합니다. 회사는 고객이 온라인과 직접을 통해 연결하고, 거래하고, 지불금을 보내고 받을 수 있을 뿐만 아니라 은행 계좌, PayPal 또는 Venmo 계정 잔액, 소비자 신용 및 직불 상품, 신용 및 직불 카드, 암호화폐, 기프트 카드 및 적격 보상을 포함한 기타 가치 저장 상품과 같은 다양한 자금 출처를 사용하여 자금을 이체 및 인출할 수 있도록 판매자와 소비자를 연결하는 대규모 양면 네트워크를 운영합니다. PayPal, PayPal Credit, Braintree, Venmo, Xoom, Hyperwallet, Honey 및 Paidy 이름으로 결제 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1998년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 산호세에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":34533958390.0,"rev_lo":34302917759.0,"rev_hi":34763000000.0,"rev_g":0.041100003,"n":41,"eps":5.57951,"eps_lo":5.37,"eps_hi":5.67,"eps_g":0.0508},{"period":"2027","rev":35923902260.0,"rev_lo":34755434050.0,"rev_hi":3